{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world ended, but that doesn't mean fun has to end too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nitro &amp; Necros is a casual roguelite where you can choose from a variety of upgrades to become even more powerful as you run over hordes of zombies! The main focus is surviving and building the ultimate mortal machine, wrecking everything that moves in the blink of an eye!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Destroy crowds of zombies and survive!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834750/extras/e1ecbf50fe6e5d7e56372976e268a80d.poster.avif?t=1759981031\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834750/extras/e1ecbf50fe6e5d7e56372976e268a80d.webm?t=1759981031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834750/extras/e1ecbf50fe6e5d7e56372976e268a80d.mp4?t=1759981031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaos is your ally! Break the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose between different upgrades every time you level up!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834750/extras/2ab65aeb7c6af5c3f6d512d65663dbda.poster.avif?t=1759981031\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834750/extras/2ab65aeb7c6af5c3f6d512d65663dbda.webm?t=1759981031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834750/extras/2ab65aeb7c6af5c3f6d512d65663dbda.mp4?t=1759981031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nitro &amp; Necros is a simple game with deep and complex choices that can lead you into different playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Unlock different characters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834750/extras/36beb9f178e09cf4bda88d6b39b1de14.webp?t=1759981031\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834750/extras/36beb9f178e09cf4bda88d6b39b1de14.poster.webp?t=1759981031\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=240 /></picture></span>Each character has unique base stats and a special hability that will change completely how you play the game! <br><strong> </strong><br>The game also has permanent upgrades that you can unlock as long as you collect the bills!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3834750?t=1759981031","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3834750?t=1759981031","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834750/f371caeb5cf2d76c837772923228e28fae8db8b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759981031","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834750/f371caeb5cf2d76c837772923228e28fae8db8b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759981031","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world ended, but that doesn't mean fun has to end too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nitro &amp; Necros is a casual roguelite where you can choose from a variety of upgrades to become even more powerful as you run over hordes of zombies! The main focus is su